Shoot!

797
01:05:04.321 --> 01:05:06.182
Behind you!

798
01:05:09.278 --> 01:05:10.718
It's coming!
Move! Move!

799
01:05:18.942 --> 01:05:20.630
- Parts I do!
- Look out!

800
01:05:31.867 --> 01:05:32.878
No, Butcher!

801
01:05:36.144 --> 01:05:37.056
Butcher!

802
01:05:40.938 --> 01:05:41.982
Go! Go!

803
01:05:43.356 --> 01:05:44.753
