- Our Leader.

884
01:13:00.147 --> 01:13:01.808
- The kingdom needs you.
- I need you.

885
01:13:02.946 --> 01:13:05.635
I mean... We need you.

886
01:13:10.766 --> 01:13:12.579
Who feels like crushing a wedding?

887
01:13:13.248 --> 01:13:14.391
Yes!

888
