- Your Majesty!

902
01:15:47.874 --> 01:15:51.290
If you can not deal with a few bandits,
is not worthy of being a leader.

903
01:15:51.431 --> 01:15:53.027
The Nobility want you out.

904
01:15:53.659 --> 01:15:56.652
