912
01:16:44.850 --> 01:16:47.420
- Ready! Enough!
- You do not understand!

913
01:16:48.154 --> 01:16:54.149
- Longing for the nectar of her skin...
- Nectar of her skin?

914
01:16:54.226 --> 01:16:58.566
