It was a perfect kiss first.

982
01:23:16.913 --> 01:23:18.126
Snow White...
Snow White!

983
01:23:19.708 --> 01:23:20.993
Unlock !
Snow White!

984
01:23:21.465 --> 01:23:23.138
Snow White!
Unlock the door, Snow White!

985
